        "Body": {
          "ContentType": "html",
          "Content": "<div><div><p><span><span>Azure Database for MySQL triggers for Azure Functions</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>are</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>now g</span><span>enerally avail</span><span>a</span><span>ble</span><span>,<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>enabling<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>you<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>to<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>set up</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>change tracking and develop event-driven applications at scale on any MySQL table.<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>You can trigger a function<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>when a row in a MySQL table is created, updated, or deleted</span><span>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span><span></span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span></span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/mysqltriggers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.</span></span></p></div><br></div>",
          "Markdown": "Azure Database for MySQL triggers for Azure Functions are now g enerally avail a ble , enabling you to set up change tracking and develop event-driven applications at scale on any MySQL table. You can trigger a function when a row in a MySQL table is created, updated, or deleted .\n\nLearn more ."
